WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.380
Two people meet in a park for the first time.

2
00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:07.530
Cześć! Mam na imię Anna.

3
00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.880
Cześć! Jestem Piotr.

4
00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:12.290
Miło mi cię poznać.

5
00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.160
Mnie też.

6
00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:18.970
Then they say where they are from.

7
00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:21.360
Jestem z Polski.

8
00:00:22.310 --> 00:00:23.870
Jestem z Hiszpanii.

9
00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.160
To ask a friend, or a child, their name:

10
00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:31.210
Jak masz na imię?

11
00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:37.480
This question is informal: for one person you know well, or a child.

12
00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:41.630
Mam na imię Anna.

13
00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:46.310
These three words, then your first name.

14
00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:49.900
Jestem z Polski.

15
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:53.580
These two words, then the country.

16
00:00:53.930 --> 00:01:00.090
The country name changes its ending, so for now, learn these as whole phrases.

17
00:01:01.840 --> 00:01:06.400
Anna says hi and gives her name. What does she say?

18
00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:12.300
Cześć! Mam na imię Anna.

19
00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:16.860
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

20
00:01:18.660 --> 00:01:21.060
Cześć! Mam na imię Anna.

21
00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:26.180
They shake hands. What does Anna say?

22
00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:31.240
Miło mi cię poznać.

23
00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:35.800
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

24
00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:39.160
Miło mi cię poznać.

25
00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:45.640
Piotr is from Poland. What does he say?

26
00:01:49.140 --> 00:01:50.580
Jestem z Polski.

27
00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:55.140
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

28
00:01:56.940 --> 00:01:58.380
Jestem z Polski.

29
00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:04.700
Now introduce yourself in the exercises below the video.
